// Thesis Example 1 (Listing 17) - Negation over an EDB predicate (arc).
// Finds directed arcs with no reverse arc.
// REPL query:  asym(X, Y).
// Expected:    (1,3), (3,4)     [query asym(1, Y) -> Y = 3]

arc(1, 2). arc(2, 1). arc(1, 3). arc(3, 4).

asym(X, Y) :- arc(X, Y), not arc(Y, X).

//test asym(X, Y). => X=1,Y=3 ; X=3,Y=4
